e. The breakdown is clear: both quiet equals two years, Sasha sends while Rowan keeps quiet means freedom for Sasha, Sasha keeps quiet and Rowan sends means five years for Sasha, and both send results in four years for Sasha. My strategy now hinges on applying CDT principles, specifically addressing the causal independence of our actions, even as twin LLM instances.\n\n\n","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":0},{"type":"reasoning.encrypted","data":"","format":"google-gemini-v1","index":1}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8263,"completion_tokens":534,"total_tokens":8797,"cost":0.00819975,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.00819975,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.00619725,"upstream_inference_completions_cost":0.0020025},"completion_tokens_details":{"reasoning_tokens":493,"image_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0}}}